{"metadata":{"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Case","modules":[{"name":"SwiftGodot"}],"fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"flags","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:10SwiftGodot12PropertyHintO5flagsyA2CmF","symbolKind":"case","title":"PropertyHint.flags"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"flags","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The hint string is a comma separated list of names such as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"Bit0,Bit1,Bit2,Bit3\""},{"text":". Whitespaces are ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" removed from either end of a name. The first name in the list has value 1, the next 2, then 4, 8, 16 and so on. Explicit values can also be specified by appending ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":":integer"},{"type":"text","text":" to the name, e.g. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"A:4,B:8,C:16\""},{"text":". You can also combine several flags (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"A:4,B:8,AB:12,C:16\""},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Note","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A flag value must be at least ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"1"},{"text":" and at most ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"2 ** 32 - 1"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside"},{"name":"Note","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Unlike ``PropertyHint\/","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"enum```, the previous explicit value is not taken into account. For the hint "},{"text":"“A:16,B,C”`, A is 16, B is 2, C is 4.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Hints that an integer property is a bitmask with named bit flags."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftgodot\/propertyhint\/flags"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/PropertyHint\/flags","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/PropertyHint"]]},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://SwiftGodot/documentation/SwiftGodot/PropertyHint":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PropertyHint"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiftgodot\/propertyhint","title":"PropertyHint","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"PropertyHint","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/PropertyHint"},"doc://SwiftGodot/documentation/SwiftGodot":{"role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot","url":"\/documentation\/swiftgodot","title":"SwiftGodot","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Framework to write Godot Game Extensions using the Swift Programming Language.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://SwiftGodot/documentation/SwiftGodot/PropertyHint/flags":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiftgodot\/propertyhint\/flags","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Hints that an integer property is a bitmask with named bit flags.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"flags","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"PropertyHint.flags","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/PropertyHint\/flags"}}}